00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:01.735 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Our first guest tonight
is a Grammy-nominated musician

00:00:01.735 --> 00:00:05.338
and actress. She's hosting
the E! People's Choice Award

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:07.073 line:92%
