some time goes by,

00:03:14.861 --> 00:03:16.796 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I think that
we're on the right path

00:03:16.796 --> 00:03:19.599 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, yeah,
I'm very, very excited.

00:03:19.599 --> 00:03:22.035 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It definitely --
I think all of Saturday

00:03:22.035 --> 00:03:24.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
