00:03:24.204 --> 00:03:26.806 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I can only imagine
how you felt leaving one

00:03:26.806 --> 00:03:27.607 line:92%
and then getting that news

00:03:27.607 --> 00:03:29.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was like
double meditation retreat.

00:03:29.943 --> 00:03:32.245 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Right. Right.
[ Both laugh ]

00:03:32.245 --> 00:03:34.614
